<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6042" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίπῠρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with fire at each end,</i> of the double-pointed
			thunderbolt, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				212
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					559
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειράδες Παρνασοῦ . . ἵνα
				Βάκχιος ἀμφιπύρους ἀνέχων πεύκας . . πηδᾶ</span>
			<i>with twin fires,</i> of two peaks of Parnassus, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ion</u>
				716
			</span></i>; of Artemis as <i>bearing a torch in either hand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				214
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with fire all round,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίποδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1405
				</span></i>
			.</div>
